An easier way to get Gate Escape working is when you select it and it keeps flashing the selection for hand controls then hit halt. TYPE IN THE FOLLOWING COMMAND
A=200;goto 4 (go) if you want to use individual hand controls (player 1 uses 1, 2 uses 2, etc.)
or
A=201;goto 4 (go) if you want use #1 hand control for all players
after this, the game will run fine until you reload it from the cart the next time.
KEn















