Hi Bill,
Bally BASIC and AstroBASIC carts only gave you 2 main colors BC (background Color) and FC (foergroung color)
Witrh the extended BASICS, you have BC, FA, FB, FC.  FA & FB are colors that the Bally has always had available for machine language, but to save space, they were not available until Jay Fenton designed extended BASIC (originally called Hot Rod Bally Basic). The others, Blue Ram and ViperSoft are off shoots of Hot Rod.
I hope this clarifies your question.
Ken


















